{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1978"},"reason":"Added a note that the Tugela Falls ranking is disputed (usually second at 948 m behind Angel Falls, but first by total height in the World Waterfall Database; 983 m by a 2016 Czech survey).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.worldwaterfalldatabase.com/tallest-waterfalls/total-height"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tugela_Falls"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",59],["+"," The ranking of Tugela Falls is disputed: it is usually listed second (948 m) behind Angel Falls (979 m), but the World Waterfall Database ranks it first by total height, and a Czech survey of 2016 measured 983 m."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",53],["+"," Die Rangfolge der Tugela-Fälle ist umstritten: Meist werden sie mit 948 m als zweithöchste nach dem Salto Ángel (979 m) geführt, die World Waterfall Database stellt sie nach Gesamthöhe jedoch an die erste Stelle, und eine tschechische Vermessung von 2016 ergab 983 m."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",47],["+"," Место водопада Тугела в рейтинге спорно: обычно его называют вторым (948 м) после Анхеля (979 м), однако World Waterfall Database ставит его на первое место по общей высоте, а чешская экспедиция в 2016 году намерила 983 м."]]}],"hash":"b77ec7b90cb2","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"230aa6da90a5b0dde147f0a66d93a0e2fd6d1f06be9d05ccc730d391965d1b17"},
{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w09890"},"reason":"The question asserted that Tugela Falls is 'regarded as the second highest in the world', but the ranking is disputed: the World Waterfall Database lists Tugela first by total height and a 2016 Czech survey measured 983 m. The question now identifies the fall by its official 948 m five-step drop and its rivalry with Angel Falls, which is true on every reading.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.worldwaterfalldatabase.com/tallest-waterfalls/total-height"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tugela_Falls"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which waterfall in South Africa's Drakensberg mountains is regarded, at 948 metres, as the second highest in the world?","new":"Which waterfall in South Africa's Drakensberg mountains, with an official total drop of 948 metres in five steps, vies with Angel Falls for the title of the world's highest?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welcher Wasserfall in den südafrikanischen Drakensbergen gilt mit 948 Metern als zweithöchster der Welt?","new":"Welcher Wasserfall in den südafrikanischen Drakensbergen, mit offiziell 948 Metern Gesamthöhe in fünf Stufen, macht dem Salto Ángel den Titel des höchsten Wasserfalls der Welt streitig?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какой водопад в Драконовых горах ЮАР высотой 948 метров считается вторым по высоте в мире?","new":"Какой водопад в Драконовых горах ЮАР, официальная высота пяти каскадов которого составляет 948 метров, оспаривает у водопада Анхель звание самого высокого в мире?"}],"hash":"68b957d9d92d","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"8d0823db3f387539cf7ab3240dc45bf90bf18633d1bfe2a1f3f9a510a91ad77b"},
